<title>USA: ESS Technology wins orders.</title>
<headline>ESS Technology wins orders.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESS Technology Inc on Tuesday said it has received two new orders for $15 million each for its MPEG-1 video CD chips.</p>
<p>The orders come from  Lihahao, a consumer audio electronic design manufacturer based in Shenzhen, China, and from  Shenzen Mountain, a video CD system manufacturer also in Shenzhen.</p>
<p>The orders are scheduled for shipment between now and January, 1998.</p>
<p>ESS shares were up 2 at 28-1/8 near the end of trading.</p>
